WEBVTT

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:41.430
Hey, did you hear?

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:45.480
There's a new cosmetic that's really popular
in the capital of Rakuyou.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.280
I did! I did!

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.540
It makes your skin all luscious!

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:53.340
I'd like that. Wouldn't you?

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:54.760
Yeah, I would!

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:10.020
Package! Package! Package!

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.950
Thanks!

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.440
Hey! Did you hear?

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.470
A new sweet just came out.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:23.650
Yeah. It combines bean jam
and fruit filling in a bun.

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:25.160
Yeah! That's the one!

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:28.620
I'd love to try it. Wouldn't you?

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:36.420
Package! Package! Package!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:38.560
Thanks!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.090
Come to think of it...

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.770
Package!

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.640
And...

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.140
Package!

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:49.690
Did you hear about the blue fruit tree everyone's talking about?

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.310
I did! I did!

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:54.100
If you eat it, your vision will improve.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:57.180
My eyes are bad, so I'd like to try it.

00:02:57.180 --> 00:02:59.590
They say it's really good for you!

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:01.810
I'd thought that since they
were so fixated on success

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:05.980
and so extremely shallow and stupid,

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:12.680
they'd spark massive riots and plunge the land
into chaos, thus filling it with power.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:15.710
Perhaps I chose the wrong
people for the job.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:19.140
Well, I guess I'll sit back and
watch a little longer.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:23.670
Everyone, you'll bring Chihou
what she wants, right?

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:30.430
<b>Episode 10
Koumei Wishes for a Sister</b>

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.710
Say "ah"!

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.070
Ryuubi-dono!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:43.950
No. I'm not Ryuubi-dono anymore!

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:44.910
Ryuubi-dono?

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.140
We're sisters, so call me Onee-chan!

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:51.540
That was just something Rin Rin...

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.260
What's wrong, Rin Rin?

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:55.070
You look upset.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.830
Rin Rin?

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:03.020
It's not fair that you get
all the attention, Aisha!

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.930
Oh, why didn't you say so?

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:09.580
Come, Ryuubi-dono. If you must
do that, do it with Rin Rin-

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.600
No!

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:15.920
I don't want her to do it. I want you to!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:16.950
Huh?

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.320
Why do I have to?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:27.950
Your older sister, Ryuubi's, feeding you!
And you're my older sister, so you should feed me!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.040
Otherwise, it's not fair!

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:33.580
What kind of theory is that?!

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:35.750
Rin Rin!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:42.270
I've seen silly fights before,
but I think this one takes the cake.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:43.740
Right, Shuri?

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:46.650
Shuri?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.180
Huh? Yeah...

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.740
Sisters, huh?

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:21.750
I had a pair of sisters, too,
until my family got separated.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.120
So tiny!

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.340
This is my younger sister?

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.240
That's not fair, sister!

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.060
I'll do it, too!

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.070
She's so cute.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:53.200
Once again, we're walking
through the mountains!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.800
We've got lunches, and we're walking
through the mountains!

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:01.410
Even if there are bears, we're walking
through the mountains!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:02.950
What's wrong, Shuri?

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:07.260
This is your first time returning to your village
in quite a while, but you don't look happy.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:10.140
Th-That's not true.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:14.990
Are you worried because you made us take
a side trip on our way back to Touka Village?

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:16.480
No...

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.850
Don't worry about that.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:24.440
We're in no real hurry to return,
and I'd like to see Suikyou-dono again.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:35.040
It's really foggy.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.330
The fog's getting thicker and thicker.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.950
Now I'm feeling foggy.
Were we already here?

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.180
That's funny!

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:44.550
I'm glad you thought it was funny!

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.430
Come to think of it,

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:54.350
the last time we came through here,
you got separated in this fog, right, Sei?

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.260
Yeah, I remember that.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.730
Don't let that happen again, OK?

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:00.230
Of course.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.400
I didn't mean to do it.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:04.770
In the first place...

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:08.740
Chou'un-san...

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:14.010
Jeez! I just told her not to get lost!

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.900
Could this be...

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:21.280
This means that masked freak
will show up again.

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:23.140
Yeah.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:30.550
Today, we're walking through
the mountains, and it's fun.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:34.280
We've got our lunches, and we're
walking through the mountains.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:36.970
Ah, are you sure we don't need
to look for Chou'un-san?

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:41.580
Soon she'll jump out of a bush
or something, so don't worry.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.940
Yeah.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:48.110
Anyway, look. We're almost there.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.370
Hello!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.670
There are a lot of people
with weapons out there?

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.180
Sensei!

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:30.750
Sensei!

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.150
Suikyou-sensei!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.890
Shuri...

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.240
It's really you!

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.200
It's been too long, Sensei!

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.910
Yes, it has.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:45.790
But you should have written
that you were coming.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.670
I'm sorry!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:52.380
We were just passing by on our journey,
and I decided I wanted to see you!

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:56.470
I see. Shuri, you've gotten so big.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.010
Sensei!

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.530
Shuri!

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:06.810
Suikyou-dono, hello.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.220
I'm sorry, Kan'u-san.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.650
And Chouhi-chan, too.

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:14.100
Hi!

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.330
Greetings.

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.030
My name is Ryuubi.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.560
Welcome to my humble home.

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:22.870
Thank you for taking such
good care of Shuri.

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:25.820
No, it's really nothing.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:29.460
Actually, it's more the other way around.
She's helped us.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.860
Sensei, who's that?

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.340
Oh. I haven't introduced you, have I?

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:42.430
That's Houtou, another orphan
who was given into my care.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:46.190
I suppose she'd be your sister-student.

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:48.900
Sister-student...

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:58.350
Hi, Houtou-chan!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.250
She's very reserved.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:05.820
What does "reserved" mean?

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:10.480
It's the last word anyone would
use to describe you.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:19.340
Come, everyone! I don't have much
to offer, but come inside anyway.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.470
I'm honored.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.500
Thank you!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.220
Thank you very much.

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:25.930
You're really enjoying yourself, Shuri.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.770
I haven't cooked here for so long!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:34.860
Come to think of it, the two of us always
cooked together while you were here.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:38.490
You taught me so many cooking techniques!

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:44.230
But I never imagined you'd become
so good at cooking.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.950
Really?

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:50.790
Well, at first, you were scared
of lighting a fire.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:55.850
Jeez... That was when I was really little!

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:57.220
It was, wasn't it?

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:59.210
It was!

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.590
Sensei!

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.450
OK, then let's all make dinner.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.320
Yeah!

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:07.000
OK.

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.790
You shouldn't do that, Houtou-chan!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:16.620
Holding a knife that way is dangerous.

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.240
I'll do it.

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:28.960
Shuri, give it a taste would you?

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:29.710
Sure!

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:34.160
What do you think?

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:38.510
Hmm, I think you should
add some more salt.

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.720
Yeah?

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.460
Please go get some salt then.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:42.240
OK!

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.850
Thanks, Shuri.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:45.970
You're welcome!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.340
This is really good!

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:55.970
It's been a long time since Shuri cooked
us a real meal. She's gotten better!

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.360
What about you, Rin Rin?

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:03.060
Can you make anything
other than rice balls?

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:08.450
I can make egg over rice and also green
tea over rice. I'm getting much better!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.650
Impressive.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:21.300
But when I look at you, Koumei-chan and Suikyou-san
seem almost like a real mother and child.

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.560
Houtou-chan, huh?

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:40.680
<i>I suppose she'd be your
sister-student.</i>

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:44.090
A sister-student, she said!

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:54.730
Sensei!

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:56.790
The bath is ready!

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:59.390
Open up!

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:01.780
Ryuubi-dono, enough already!

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.610
Jeez... You're still calling me that.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.020
Call me Onee-chan!

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.580
I said...

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:11.340
You need to feed me, Aisha-oneechan!

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.180
Hey.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:19.480
I've prepared your beds in the
guest rooms, so please rest there.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.960
Thank you!

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.280
Thank you very much.

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:27.410
Shuri, right now, she's using your room,

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:30.490
so you two sleep there tonight, OK?

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.450
OK!

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:35.830
What is it?

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.320
What's wrong?

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.300
No.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:43.230
I don't want to sleep with
someone I don't know.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.260
Fine.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.950
Then sleep with me tonight, OK?

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:05.220
It's been a really long time
since I slept in this room.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.400
The same bed...

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.980
The same pillow...

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:16.920
It smells just a little different
than my hair.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:22.710
Yeah... This is Houtou-chan's room now.

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.450
<i>No.</i>

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:27.170
<i>I don't want to sleep with
someone I don't know.</i>

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:35.140
I hope I can make friends
with her tomorrow.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:44.040
Today's the perfect day
for a nap in the sun!

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:46.330
Chouhi-chan!

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.700
What?

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:51.580
It's dangerous to sleep up there!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:57.230
Sorry, I just like smoke, high places, and stuff!

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:58.890
"And stuff"?

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:03.310
Everyone ate a lot today.

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:04.380
They sure did.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:07.880
What is it?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.340
What's wrong?

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.840
Sensei. Today...

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:18.710
That's right. I promised to go
pick herbs with you today.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:25.480
But we have guests today.
We'll have to do it another time.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.900
But you promised...

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:32.320
Yeah, I did.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:36.140
But be a good girl and listen, OK?

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:44.640
Sensei, shall I go in your place?

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:48.260
That would help...

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:53.720
I'd love to see the mountain
where we used to pick herbs again.

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:55.370
Yeah?

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:57.310
OK, thank you.

00:15:57.460 --> 00:15:58.670
OK!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.270
Let's go, Houtou-chan!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.280
It hasn't changed a bit since
the last time I was here!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:16.910
That's anmerusou.
It's good for stiff shoulders.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:21.370
And that's panshirosou. For sunburn!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:24.120
And that's kourakusou. For constipation...

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:44.300
Houtou-chan!

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:48.000
Did you find any herbs?

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:58.220
That's fine. You don't know
this mountain all that well yet.

00:16:58.220 --> 00:16:59.690
Oh, I know!

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:03.310
If you want, I'll give you some
of the ones I picked-

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.370
I'm sorry!

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:12.810
I just wanted to be friends with you...

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:14.170
So...

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:17.350
I don't want to be your friend.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.020
I hate you!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.950
I hate you! I hate you! I hate you!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:22.770
Wait!

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:28.730
<i>Wait!</i>

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.450
Houtou-chan, wait!

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.520
Wait, Houtou-chan.

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:49.880
If I did something, I apologize!

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:52.340
No. Stay back.

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.100
Houtou-chan, don't move!

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:05.350
I'll be right there, so stay still!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.650
H-Houtou-chan...

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:17.450
I-I'm not scared! I'm not scared!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.640
I'm not s-scared of heights!

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.790
Houtou-chan...

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:30.210
Just wait. I'm almost there...

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.400
I'm almost there!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:39.470
Hang on!

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:46.250
It's OK now.

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.830
Hang on!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:57.920
I'm so glad, I'm so glad...
Houtou-chan, I'm so glad!

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:00.910
Koumei-chan...

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:13.900
Until I ended up here, all my relatives
had passed me from one to another.

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:19.840
But since I couldn't even take care of myself,
everyone always treated me like a burden.

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:30.640
But... But the first person to be nice to me was
Suikyou-sensei. She's like my real mother.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:34.880
She told me all about you.

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:38.450
That you were a good girl
and really smart...

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:42.110
So, I wanted to be friends.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:48.940
I wanted you to teach me about
books and herbs and things.

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:55.160
But when I saw how friendly
you were with her,

00:19:55.160 --> 00:20:03.180
I felt like you would take her from me. And then
my chest just clenched up, and I felt awful.

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:08.230
I didn't plan to be so mean.

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:09.640
But I...

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:13.730
Houtou-chan, I'm not mad at all.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:20.570
No. I'm happy you like Sensei so much!

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.820
I love Sensei!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:27.880
And you love her, too!

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:30.540
So we're together!

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:34.810
Koumei-chan...

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:45.560
Houtou-chan...

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.300
Hinari.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.050
My given name.

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:51.720
Then...

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:53.610
We're friends.

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:54.980
So call me Hinari!

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:01.680
Bye, Shuri-chan!

00:21:01.680 --> 00:21:03.400
Be careful!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.810
Hinari-chan, until next time!

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:08.870
Bye!

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:11.870
Come see me again, OK?

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.080
Make sure you do!

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:18.520
I'm sure... I'm sure I will, Hinari-chan!

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:27.890
We have to stop our performance now? Why?

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.770
Because you have to!

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:36.600
Large events like this need
government permits.

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:40.820
But our manager said he'd
gotten permission!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:45.530
I don't know anything about that.

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:47.490
I-It can't be...

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:52.700
Please! Just this once, let us
finish our performance!

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.710
Everyone was looking forward to it!

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:06.870
Well, I suppose we could
work something out...

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:09.390
But you know, one hand washes the other.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:13.360
If you don't have any money to pay...

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:18.770
I don't mind being paid in other ways.

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:19.950
Hey!

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:21.730
Get your hands off of Ren-tan!

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:27.510
Hey!

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:28.830
No violence!

00:22:30.750 --> 00:22:33.040
You'll pay for that!

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:37.160
Everyone, please!

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:40.040
Get that filthy man!

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:48.050
What the heck is this?

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:55.020
Kill! Kill! Kill!

00:24:25.610 --> 00:24:27.070
Awawa... Awawa!

00:24:27.070 --> 00:24:29.080
Awawa! It's Awawa!

00:24:29.080 --> 00:24:29.960
Awawa?

00:24:29.960 --> 00:24:33.180
Awawa was a strategist I used to have!

00:24:33.180 --> 00:24:37.490
But their mind stat was over 90,
so grandpa said I had to send them back to-

00:24:37.490 --> 00:24:41.250
But are you sure that strategist is the
same strategist you used to own?

00:24:41.250 --> 00:24:45.420
I can prove it! Awawa had black
hair between her thighs...

00:24:45.420 --> 00:24:46.670
She doesn't.

